        "text": "TabFM is here for zero-shot tabular prediction. \n \nhttps://\nmodelscope.ai/models/google/\ntabfm-1.0.0-pytorch\n…\n\n On TabArena, it was evaluated across 51 datasets and beats heavily tuned supervised baselines, including gradient-boosted trees, without task-specific fine-tuning.\n\nWhat it does:\n• Classification and regression on mixed numerical + categorical tables\n•  In-context learning from training rows to test-row predictions\n•  No hyperparameter search or task-specific fine-tuning\n•  Alternating row/column attention + row compression\n\nLicense: TabFM Non-Commercial v1.0 for weights, Apache 2.0 for code.",
